7. Schedule, Resources, and Risk Feasibility
7.1 Available Team Time
The available team time is calculated using the number of students, the estimated weekly contribution of each student, and the number of remaining weeks.
Available team hours
Available team hours = Number of members × Hours per member per week × Available weeks
3 members × 6 hours per week × 9 weeks = 162 hours
The planned project activities are estimated to require 129 team hours.
Schedule buffer
Schedule buffer = Available hours − Planned hours
162 hours − 129 hours = 33 hours
The percentage of available time is:
(129 ÷ 162) × 100 = 79.6%
The remaining schedule buffer is:
100% − 79.6% = 20.4%
The 33-hour buffer will  be used for corrections, technical problems, or missed meetings. This is important because the project contains several connected modules.

